1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,420
"Choking to death.

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,330
Woot, woot."

3
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:07,530
(Theatre staff:)Guys, I am sorry.
We are full up.

4
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:08,930
(Sheldon:)No!

5
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,200
(Theatre staff:)We're full up.

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,630
(Leonard:)We really want
to see this.

7
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:13,970
Isn't there anything
you can do?

8
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:16,040
(Theatre staff:)Sorry. Fire regulations.
Should've gotten here earlier.

9
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,870
(Sheldon:)This is nothing but a
blatant abuse of power

10
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:20,540
(Sheldon:)by a petty functionary.

11
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:23,010
(Sheldon:)Explain to me why
Wil Wheaton and his lackeys

12
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:24,710
(Sheldon:)get in and we don't.

13
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:28,550
'Cause I'm the petty functionary
with a clipboard, bitch.

14
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,550
(Howard:)I guess that's that.

15
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,220
(Howard:)Let's go home.

16
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,240
(Sheldon:)You know what?

17
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,860
(Sheldon:)I'm going back to
"I told you so."

18
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,110
(Sheldon:)I told you so.

19
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,750
(Raj:)We can still see something.

20
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,450
Oh, the new Sandra Bullock movie
is playing two blocks away.

21
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:46,970
(Raj:)You know Sandy B.
always brings it.

22
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:49,400
(Sheldon:)Look-- a side door.

23
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,970
(Sheldon:)Come on, Short Round.

24
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:54,010
(Howard:)I guess we'd better
go after him.

25
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,410
(Leonard:)Short Round?

26
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:57,130
Indy's young sidekick
from Temple of Doom.

